        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion AM, Navajo Collection Concha Lever</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nLike its name, Fusion Hardware's Concha Lever mirrors southwestern design. It is fashioned to look like the detailing found on cowboy's saddles. Made out of solid brass, it is available in antique pewter and antique copper finishes. It will fit 1-1/4 inch to 2 inch thick doors and has an optional 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Fusion AM Concha Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solid Brass/Bronze Construction</li>\r\n<li>Cycle Tested to ANSI Standards</li>\r\n<li>”Positive Stop” lever spring mechanism</li>\r\n<li>Reversible Latchbolt in matching/coordinating finish</li>\r\n<li>Easy assembly with alignment block and rose posts</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Southwest Door Lever Fusion AM:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lever Length:  4\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection:  1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: Either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass or Bronze</li>\r\n<li>Standard Latch Rotation is 40 Degrees.</li>\r\n<li>Square corner latches and strike plates </li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on one side of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Set:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on both sides of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Concha Solid Brass Lever, Fusion AM",
                "description": "Fusion AM Concha Door Lever - Like its name, Fusion Hardware's Concha Lever mirrors southwestern design. It is fashioned to look like the detailing found on cowboy's saddles. Made out of solid brass, it is available in Antique Pewter and Antique Copper finishes.  It will fit 1-1/4 inch to 2 inch thick doors and can be adjusted for either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.",
